1
-1:59:59,958 --> 00:00:04,383
HCF into LCM barabar product —
kya ye hamesha sahi hai?

2
00:00:04,455 --> 00:00:08,367
Do numbers lo: 6 aur 20.
HCF 2, LCM 60.

3
00:00:08,488 --> 00:00:12,650
2 into 60 — 120.
Aur 6 into 20 bhi 120.

4
00:00:12,725 --> 00:00:15,270
Do positive integers ke liye
ye hamesha sahi hai.

5
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:31,467
Ye formula sirf do numbers ke liye hai.

6
00:00:31,583 --> 00:00:35,735
Teen numbers mein prime factorisation
se HCF aur LCM nikaalo.

